UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetSecondsAgo
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when seconds ago is less than minimum seconds ago
    │   └── it should revert with "ISA"
    ├── when seconds ago is higher than maximum seconds ago
    │   └── it should revert with "ISA"
    └── when seconds ago is correct amount
        ├── it should set the new secondsAgo
        └── it should emit a {SecondsAgoSet} event

 
